{
    "title": "Weather & Radar",
    "description": "<b>Key Features of Weather & Radar\u2019s free app:</b>\r\n\u2022\tHourly and daily weather forecast\r\n\u2022\tAndroid Auto compatible\r\n\u2022\t14-day weather outlook\r\n\u2022\tWorldwide live WeatherRadar\r\n\u2022\tRainfall, Wind & Temperature Radars\r\n\u2022\tSevere weather warnings & Warning Maps\r\n\u2022\tCoastal & Tidal info\r\n\u2022\tPollen Count, UV-Index, and Air Quality info\r\n\u2022      Weather News\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1e <b>Weather App</b>\r\nBe up to date at all times with Weather & Radar\u2019s free app! Always know whether the sun will be out, a thunderstorm is approaching, if it\u2019ll rain, hail or snow. The weather app will accurately display current weather conditions for your exact position in any location worldwide. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf26 <b>Weather Forecast</b>\r\nEverything about the weather at a glance! The latest specifics on temperature, rain, probability of precipitation, snow, wind, sunshine hours, sunrise and sunset times. Detailed displays of air pressure, humidity levels and UV-Index. Plan further ahead with the 14-day weather outlook feature.  \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf29 <b>Severe Weather Warnings & Warning Maps</b>\r\nActivate severe weather warnings and receive push notifications when extreme weather conditions such as storms, thunderstorms, lightning, heavy winds or snow are underway. The Warning Maps let you see where warnings have been issued.\r\n\r\n\u2614 <b>Weather Map</b>\r\nMore than just your standard rainfall map! See the latest enhanced radar map, which includes areas of cloud cover, sunshine, rainfall, snowfall, hail, thunderstorms, and lightning strikes. This feature allows you to see meteorological conditions for various locations at once. Trace the movement of cloud formations, weather fronts and active storms to see if they will hit or bypass your location. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf3e <b>Pollen count, UV-Index, and Air Quality info</b>\r\nFind current information on pollen count, UV-Index levels and forecasts, plus air quality in your area. Weather & Radar provides free, reliable, and localised pollen, UV, and air quality information for your location.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude97 <b>Android Auto Compatible</b>\r\nAvoid surprises on the road by checking the WeatherRadar and RainfallRadar as you travel using Weather & Radar on Android Auto. See rain, snow, and thunderstorms in the immediate area and drive safe.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1e <b>Weather Widget</b>\r\nThe widget displays weather information for your current location in a compact format on the home screen of your device. Choose from 4 different widget formats and scale it according to your preference. See local temperatures and weather conditions with one tap.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0a  <b>Coastal Water Temperatures</b>\r\nKeen on water sports? Whether you want to go swimming, surfing, sailing or fishing, you can rely on Weather & Radar\u2018s free app to see water temperatures for coastal areas. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf00 <b>Thunderstorm Tracker</b>\r\nSee individual lightning strikes in the animated weather map. Cloud colouration is displayed according to heaviness of cover indicating areas of very heavy rainfall, hail and storm-like conditions. The app will also indicate wind strength and direction.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0f <b>World Weather</b>\r\nYou can rely on Weather & Radar\u2019s free app for everything from timing your walks to dodge those showers, to planning outdoor projects, activities and events. Scheduling a trip or have a family member in another country? Save any location and see current conditions for any number of global locations at once. World weather at your fingertips! \r\n\r\nUse the weather app free of advertising with the in-app purchase and profit from the option to personalise your main page! \r\n\r\nShould you have any queries or comments, kindly contact us at info@weatherandradar.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Key Features of Weather &amp; Radar\u2019s free app:</b><br>\u2022\tHourly and daily weather forecast<br>\u2022\tAndroid Auto compatible<br>\u2022\t14-day weather outlook<br>\u2022\tWorldwide live WeatherRadar<br>\u2022\tRainfall, Wind &amp; Temperature Radars<br>\u2022\tSevere weather warnings &amp; Warning Maps<br>\u2022\tCoastal &amp; Tidal info<br>\u2022\tPollen Count, UV-Index, and Air Quality info<br>\u2022      Weather News<br><br>\ud83c\udf1e <b>Weather App</b><br>Be up to date at all times with Weather &amp; Radar\u2019s free app! Always know whether the sun will be out, a thunderstorm is approaching, if it\u2019ll rain, hail or snow. The weather app will accurately display current weather conditions for your exact position in any location worldwide. <br><br>\ud83c\udf26 <b>Weather Forecast</b><br>Everything about the weather at a glance! The latest specifics on temperature, rain, probability of precipitation, snow, wind, sunshine hours, sunrise and sunset times. Detailed displays of air pressure, humidity levels and UV-Index. Plan further ahead with the 14-day weather outlook feature.  <br><br>\ud83c\udf29 <b>Severe Weather Warnings &amp; Warning Maps</b><br>Activate severe weather warnings and receive push notifications when extreme weather conditions such as storms, thunderstorms, lightning, heavy winds or snow are underway. The Warning Maps let you see where warnings have been issued.<br><br>\u2614 <b>Weather Map</b><br>More than just your standard rainfall map! See the latest enhanced radar map, which includes areas of cloud cover, sunshine, rainfall, snowfall, hail, thunderstorms, and lightning strikes. This feature allows you to see meteorological conditions for various locations at once. Trace the movement of cloud formations, weather fronts and active storms to see if they will hit or bypass your location. <br><br>\ud83c\udf3e <b>Pollen count, UV-Index, and Air Quality info</b><br>Find current information on pollen count, UV-Index levels and forecasts, plus air quality in your area. Weather &amp; Radar provides free, reliable, and localised pollen, UV, and air quality information for your location.<br><br>\ud83d\ude97 <b>Android Auto Compatible</b><br>Avoid surprises on the road by checking the WeatherRadar and RainfallRadar as you travel using Weather &amp; Radar on Android Auto. See rain, snow, and thunderstorms in the immediate area and drive safe.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1e <b>Weather Widget</b><br>The widget displays weather information for your current location in a compact format on the home screen of your device. Choose from 4 different widget formats and scale it according to your preference. See local temperatures and weather conditions with one tap.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0a  <b>Coastal Water Temperatures</b><br>Keen on water sports? Whether you want to go swimming, surfing, sailing or fishing, you can rely on Weather &amp; Radar\u2018s free app to see water temperatures for coastal areas. <br><br>\ud83c\udf00 <b>Thunderstorm Tracker</b><br>See individual lightning strikes in the animated weather map. Cloud colouration is displayed according to heaviness of cover indicating areas of very heavy rainfall, hail and storm-like conditions. The app will also indicate wind strength and direction.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0f <b>World Weather</b><br>You can rely on Weather &amp; Radar\u2019s free app for everything from timing your walks to dodge those showers, to planning outdoor projects, activities and events. Scheduling a trip or have a family member in another country? Save any location and see current conditions for any number of global locations at once. World weather at your fingertips! <br><br>Use the weather app free of advertising with the in-app purchase and profit from the option to personalise your main page! <br><br>Should you have any queries or comments, kindly contact us at info@weatherandradar.com",
